ussion: there is none yet, but we can say \"Given the criteria, I propose Candidate B\". Provide evidence.\n\nLet's produce public message: state recommendation for Candidate B, reference strengths and concerns, explain why B is best.\n\nMetadata vote: Candidate B."}
